# yog_seema: the exact sum when it fits - (2^62, 2^62) is 2^62 (v295 saturated it to 2^63 - 1); a sum past int64 still saturates; never refuses (R116, R189 row 12).
yoj sadhan

mukhya() {
    likha(yog_seema(4611686018427387904, 4611686018427387904))
    likha(yog_seema(((0 - 9223372036854775807) - 1), 9223372036854775807))
    likha(yog_seema(0, 9223372036854775807))
    likha(yog_seema(5, 4))
